{"kind": "mod", "id": 769, "name": "Kalashnikov Enhanced Modding", "slug": "kalashnikov-enhanced-modding", "teaser": "separated hangduards and barrels on ak's ? its now a thing !", "owner_name": "BALIST0N", "downloads": 2528, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "The Unlicense", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/1033.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:43.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-02-24T10:47:18.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-02-24T10:47:18.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "3.10.0+v2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/unlicense/", "description_html": "<p>This mod probably won’t be updated anymore, after BSG announcement, EFT will feature separated handguard vanilla next wipe, since i don’t have time to update it, this mod will probably die…<br />\nsorry : )</p>\n<p>this mod enhance modding abilities on AK platforms by splitting lower and upper handguards</p>\n<p>gas tubes has been separated from lowers handguard (M1-B, Troy rail…)<br />\nSiderails (RMP rails) have been separated from the guns and now are moddable items<br />\nBarrels has been Separated from the guns too</p>\n<p>this mod add 94 new possibles combinaison, with conflicting/blocking items matching<br />\nstats have been splitted between the separated parts to keep the actual meta,<br />\nand a lot of reseach has been made for weight values to match IRL part : )</p>\n<p><em>Compatibility table :</em></p>\n<p>Modname (version)<br />\ncompatiblity details</p>\n<p>i highly recommand deleting cache files (or cache icon folder) if you have issues with icon preview items : )</p>\n<h3>ATTENTION, THIS MOD MERGE/DELETE SOME AK VARIANTIONS</h3>\n<p>IF YOU HAVE ANY OF THESE WEAPON IN YOUR STASH, DELETE THEM :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AK-102</li>\n<li>AK-104</li>\n<li>AK-105</li>\n<li>AKM</li>\n<li